Aapke feedback ke mutabiq frontend me pickup glitch ko fix kiya jayega, bottom bar se pickup ko hatakar clean kiya jayega, secondary aur shop ke extra features ko ek sleek **Side Menu Drawer** me shift kiya jayega, aur frontend ko backend ke production URL configuration se connect karke deploy-ready banaya jayega.

