## 2. Proposed Changes

### A. Fix Pickup Glitch & Safe Handling
- **Root Cause of Glitch**:
  - Jab kisi user ke paas 0 reservations hote hain, Go backend `nil` slice serialize karta hai (`"reservations": null`).
  - Frontend me `data.reservations || data || []` likha tha. Kyunki `data.reservations` null tha, JavaScript ne truthy pagination object `{ reservations: null, ... }` ko state me set kar diya.
  - Phir rendering ke dauran `reservations.map()` call hone par `TypeError: reservations.map is not a function` crash (white screen/glitch) aa jata tha.
  - Saath hi `r.id.slice(0, 8)` aur date formatting me safe fallbacks nahi the.
- **Files to Modify**:
  - `frontend/src/pages/customer/ReservationsScreen.jsx`: Safe array fallback (`Array.isArray(data?.reservations) ? data.reservations : []`), safe ID format, safe date rendering, aur empty state polish.
  - `internal/handler/repository/reservation.go`: Slice initialization `make([]*model.Reservation, 0)` ensure karein taaki backend hamesha empty JSON array `[]` return kare, `null` nahi.

### B. Streamline Bottom Nav (Remove Pickup)
